{
    "name": "edit_flow",
    "title": "Change a flow",
    "description": "Change a draft or inactive flow: an ordered list of changes, saved together or not at all (up to 200). A\nrefusal says `nothing_saved`, the failing `change_index`, its `op` and why. Ops:\n`add_card` (`ref`, `type`, `name`, `settings`; every outcome starts as `stop`);\n`update_card` (`card`, `name`, `settings` merged, `replace: true` to replace them all);\n`remove_card` (`card`); `connect` (`from`, `outcome`, `to`, `actions`);\n`add_trigger` (`type`, `settings`); `update_trigger` (`trigger`, `settings` merged, `active`);\n`remove_trigger` (`trigger`);\n`update_flow` (`name`, `start_card`, `persona_id` with 0 to detach, `settings` merged, `completion_actions`).\n`card`, `from`, `to` and `start_card` take a card id or a `ref` set earlier in the call; `to` also takes\n\"stop\" or \"flow:<id>\". Flows cannot loop. The first card added starts the flow. A live flow can only be\nrenamed. The answer maps refs to card ids, and gives the checks and `warnings`: what the change broke.",
    "inputSchema": {
        "properties": {
            "flow_id": {
                "type": "integer"
            },
            "changes": {
                "items": {
                    "properties": {
                        "op": {
                            "enum": [
                                "add_card",
                                "update_card",
                                "remove_card",
                                "connect",
                                "add_trigger",
                                "update_trigger",
                                "remove_trigger",
                                "update_flow"
                            ],
                            "type": "string"
                        },
                        "ref": {
                            "type": "string"
                        },
                        "type": {
                            "type": "string"
                        },
                        "name": {
                            "type": "string"
                        },
                        "settings": {
                            "type": "object"
                        },
                        "replace": {
                            "type": "boolean"
                        },
                        "card": {
                            "type": "string"
                        },
                        "from": {
                            "type": "string"
                        },
                        "outcome": {
                            "type": "string"
                        },
                        "to": {
                            "type": "string"
                        },
                        "actions": {
                            "items": {
                                "type": "object"
                            },
                            "type": "array"
                        },
                        "trigger": {
                            "type": "integer"
                        },
                        "active": {
                            "type": "boolean"
                        },
                        "start_card": {
                            "type": "string"
                        },
                        "persona_id": {
                            "type": "integer"
                        },
                        "completion_actions": {
                            "items": {
                                "type": "object"
                            },
                            "type": "array"
                        }
                    },
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": [
                        "op"
                    ]
                },
                "type": "array"
            }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
            "flow_id",
            "changes"
        ]
    },
    "annotations": {
        "readOnlyHint": false,
        "destructiveHint": true,
        "openWorldHint": false,
        "idempotentHint": false
    },
    "_meta": {
        "ui": {
            "resourceUri": "ui://resources/flow-map-app",
            "visibility": [
                "model",
                "app"
            ]
        }
    }
}
